  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When the target version is 6+, add the ability to turn some objects into archival groups during the upgrade process. For our use case, this could be based on a list of RDF types. If a resource contains any of the specified RDF types, then it gets migrated as an AG and any children ldp:contained by it go into the same AG. If a resource that is contained by an AG in this way also has one of the specified RDF types, it has no affect.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
